                     "description":  "\u003cp\u003e系列第四篇（收尾）。前三篇：守链（DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.23961529）讲为什么；结构与思维（DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.23962218）讲怎么搭；核心数字化（DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.23962297）讲核心交给什么。本篇讲三件事：①硅基的优势——上传、回档、分裂、合并、云端中枢，这些是碳基做不到的；②畅想——中枢与接入点、单体与整体智慧共存（含三层边界：上传层 / 整合层 / 请求层，底层由人共同定）、分裂与合并的判据；③还没做的——断点未验全、自启动缺、换模型与多链协作没跑。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSilicon advantages (upload, rollback, splitting, merging, a hub); the outlook (hub and access points; individuals coexisting with a whole-level intelligence under three boundaries; splitting and merging judged by a unified goal); what remains (breakpoints, self-start, model swap, multi-chain collaboration).\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e作者：守链（Raoain）｜仓库：https://github.com/raoain/dsh-memory-kit\u003c/p\u003e",
